        },
        {
            "id": "801108",
            "objective": "Talk to Eide",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80110401",
                    "speaker": "Eide",
                    "text": "Who was that? He was... he was...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "80110402",
                            "text": "Terrifying?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "80110404",
                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                    "text": "...He was a perfect being. I'm in awe."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "80110405",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "...Huh?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "80110406",
                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                    "text": "He had the most wondrous aura, a perilous yet beautiful power... Truly mesmerizing."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "80110407",
                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                    "text": "And yet you were able to defeat him. Your strength is greater than I had imagined. Hehe...",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "80110408",
                                            "text": "You have unconventional tastes.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "80110410",
                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                    "text": "Let's continue on. I find myself growing more curious by the second... and more excited."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "80110409",
                                            "text": "I just have lots of combat experience."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "80110403",
                            "text": "I've seen similar characters before."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "801109",
            "objective": "Continue exploring",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "801110",
            "objective": "Continue exploring",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "801112",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80110601",
                    "speaker": "Eide",
                    "text": "Caribert! Oh, thank goodness. He's still okay.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "80110602",
                            "text": "Don't we still need to go to the Statue of The Seven?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "80110604",
                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                    "text": "I... I have a strange feeling that what just happened was meant to be."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "80110605",
                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                    "text": "For this to happen right at the moment when I was dreading worshiping at a Statue of The Seven... it's as if fate was calling to me."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "80110606",
                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                    "text": "You say that I bowed before that thing, so perhaps... it might be just as effective?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "80110607",
                                            "text": "That sounds like a ridiculous idea...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "80110609",
                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                    "text": "I have to try. No matter what. ...You said it yourself: I have to exhaust all options."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "80110610",
                                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                    "text": "Another dose of medicine is administered to the hilichurl..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "80110611",
                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                    "text": "Caribert...?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "80110612",
                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                    "text": "..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "80110613",
                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                    "text": "...P—Papa...?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "80110614",
                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                    "text": "*gasp* ...Caribert! Oh, my goodness, it worked! It's a miracle!!! Oh, Caribert, my dear son...",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "80110615",
                                                            "text": "I can't believe it...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110617",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "You see!? It worked! Caribert can speak again!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110618",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Where's... Mama?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110619",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "Mama is... Caribert, look at me. Do you know who I am?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110620",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Of course... You're Papa."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110621",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "Hahahaha... Yes! Haha... Salvation, sweet salvation... Yes, this is what this feeling is..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110622",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "How do you feel, Caribert? Are you fully awake now?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110623",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Yes... it feels like I just woke up from a long, long sleep. I dreamed that I was hiding in a little room. I didn't dare go out the whole time, and I didn't want to either..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110624",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Wait..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110625",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "My body! What happened to me? Is this... is this me?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110626",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Papa... What's happened to me!?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110627",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110628",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "...Don't panic, son. It's just... while you were sleeping, we went into a fairytale world."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110629",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "There's no more Khaenri'ah here, no more home — but do you know what that means? No more red sky... no more end of the world."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110630",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "In this world, you have to be a little monster... but you get to stay with Papa forever."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110631",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Am I... dead?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110632",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "No, no, of course not! Look, Caribert... you still have Mama's scarf on your arm. That means she's watching over you, protecting you. So how could you be dead?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110633",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Really...?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110634",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "Yes, really! You've only just woken up, and this must all be very confusing for you. Just rest here for now... Things will get better."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110635",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "Oh, and um... you have to promise me something..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110636",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "Never take off your mask."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110637",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "Understand? Whatever happens, you mustn't take it off..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110638",
                                                                    "speaker": "Caribert",
                                                                    "text": "Okay, Papa... I won't, I promise..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110639",
                                                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                                    "text": "Father and son talk for a long while. Eide seems like a changed man after his religious experience..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "80110640",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                    "text": "Not since that day have I been so glad as I am now... I can't believe this is really happening...",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "80110641",
                                                                            "text": "Yeah...",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "80110643",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                    "text": "Hmph, I knew that placing my hope in The Seven was a waste of time... I even worshiped at one of their statues like a common fool. Never before have I humiliated myself like that..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "80110644",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                    "text": "Once a murderer, always a murderer... I was naive to think that the gods who conspired against us would ever offer redemption."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "80110645",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                    "text": "But the god we saw in that cave... Now that was a truly mighty god! Nothing like one of The Seven!"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "80110646",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                    "text": "That wondrous power... It was truly enchanting... Surely, that must have been the reason I bowed down?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "80110647",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                    "text": "Hmm, now then... after one beseeches a god, and the god responds by answering their prayers, should they, um... do something to show their devotion?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "80110648",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                    "text": "Piety is hardly my area of expertise... but surely I should honor the god that has honored my wishes.",
                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "80110649",
                                                                                            "text": "But Eide... that was not a god.",
                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "80110651",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                                    "text": "A \"Sinner\"? Don't be absurd. You don't know a single thing about him... how dare you utter such blasphemy?"
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "80110652",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                                    "text": "You and I have both witnessed his divine power. When have The Seven worked a miracle like this before? Never... He is a god mightier than they! And yet you would call him a \"Sinner\"? Preposterous!"
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "80110653",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                                    "text": "No matter... Believe what you will. You cannot shake my faith."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "80110654",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Eide",
                                                                                                    "text": "I am going to pay my respects — with or without you.",
                                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "80110655",
                                                                                                            "text": "You...",
                                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "80110657",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                                                                    "text": "(Eide's experience has deeply affected him... Not that he was particularly stable to begin with, but this... religious fervor is something else...)"
                                                                                                                },
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "80110658",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                                                                    "text": "(I guess I'd better catch up with him anyway. There are monsters everywhere... I can't stand by and let him fall into their hands.)"
                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                            ]
                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "80110656",
                                                                                                            "text": "Fine, go ahead."
                                                                                                        }
                                                                                                    ]
                                                                                                }
                                                                                            ]
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "80110650",
                                                                                            "text": "That was... a \"Sinner.\""
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "80110642",
                                                                            "text": "It's unbelievable."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "80110616",
                                                            "text": "I'm stunned."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "80110608",
                                            "text": "But if you insist..."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "80110603",
                            "text": "Why are we back here?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
